<p class="eyebrow">VESTIGE VAPES</p>
<h1>ELFBAR <span>BC10000</span></h1>
<p class="hero-lede">Refined product information. Distinctive presentation. Clear technical detail.</p>
<p class="hero-text">Explore ELFBAR BC10000 specifications, flavour options, pricing, locker-to-locker delivery and secure ordering from Vestige Vapes in South Africa.</p>
<div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn btn-gold" href="#buy-now">Shop</a><a class="btn btn-light" href="#specifications">View technical profile</a><a class="btn btn-light" href="#flavours">Explore flavours</a></div>
</div>
