</section>
<section class="intro" id="product">
<div class="container intro-grid">
<div><p class="eyebrow gold-text">THE BC10000</p><h2>Compact form. High-capacity system.</h2><p>The ELFBAR BC10000 range available through Vestige Vapes combines a rechargeable all-in-one format with multiple flavour options. Review the technical profile, current range, pricing and delivery information before ordering. Exact specifications should always be checked against the physical packaging and applicable market documentation.</p></div>
<div class="metric-grid"><div class="metric"><strong>R300</strong><span>per BC10000 device</span></div><div class="metric"><strong>10,000</strong><span>stated maximum puff capacity*</span></div><div class="metric"><strong>620</strong><span>mAh rechargeable battery*</span></div><div class="metric"><strong>50 mg/ml</strong><span>nicotine strength*</span></div></div>
</div><div class="container footnote">*Product information supplied for the Vestige BC10000 range; specifications may vary by SKU or market.</div>
</section>
<section class="spec-section" id="specifications">
<div class="container">
<div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow gold-text">TECHNICAL PROFILE</p><h2>BC10000 technical profile</h2></div>
<div class="table-shell">
