<p class="table-note">Nicotine is addictive. Product specifications shown here are based on the supplied Vestige product profile; verify the physical packaging for the exact SKU before relying on a specification.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section class="features"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading center"><p class="eyebrow gold-text">DESIGN</p><h2>Designed around simplicity</h2><p>The BC10000 uses a draw-activated, button-free design with a pre-filled system. No refill procedure or coil replacement is required.</p></div><div class="feature-grid"><article><span class="feature-number">01</span><h3>Rechargeable</h3><p>620 mAh rechargeable battery with USB-C charging.</p></article><article><span class="feature-number">02</span><h3>Draw-activated</h3><p>Automatic activation without a physical firing button.</p></article><article><span class="feature-number">03</span><h3>High capacity</h3><p>Manufacturer-style stated capacity of up to 10,000 puffs, usage dependent.</p></article><article><span class="feature-number">04</span><h3>Sealed system</h3><p>Pre-filled and non-refillable all-in-one format.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="flavours" id="flavours"><div class="container">
<div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow gold-text">FLAVOUR RANGE</p><h2>Five BC10000 variants</h2><p>True-to-life flavour presentation, with the ingredient cues and profile notes kept concise.</p></div>
<div class="flavour-grid five" data-flavour-card="blueberry-mint" tabindex="0" role="link" aria-label="Explore Blueberry Mint" onclick="window.location.href='/flavours/blueberry-mint'" onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter'||event.key===' '){event.preventDefault();window.location.href='/flavours/blueberry-mint'}" data-flavour-card="miami-mint" tabindex="0" role="link" aria-label="Explore Miami Mint" onclick="window.location.href='/flavours/miami-mint'" onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter'||event.key===' '){event.preventDefault();window.location.href='/flavours/miami-mint'}" data-flavour-card="blue-razz-ice" tabindex="0" role="link" aria-label="Explore Blue Razz Ice" onclick="window.location.href='/flavours/blue-razz-ice'" onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter'||event.key===' '){event.preventDefault();window.location.href='/flavours/blue-razz-ice'}" data-flavour-card="strawberry-kiwi-ice" tabindex="0" role="link" aria-label="Explore Strawberry Kiwi Ice" onclick="window.location.href='/flavours/strawberry-kiwi-ice'" onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter'||event.key===' '){event.preventDefault();window.location.href='/flavours/strawberry-kiwi-ice'}" data-flavour-card="watermelon-ice" tabindex="0" role="link" aria-label="Explore Watermelon Ice" onclick="window.location.href='/flavours/watermelon-ice'" onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter'||event.key===' '){event.preventDefault();window.location.href='/flavours/watermelon-ice'}">
<article class="flavour f-blue"><div class="ingredient">🫐 <span>🍃</span></div><h3>Blueberry Mint</h3><p>Blueberry fruit notes with a cool mint finish.</p><span class="flavour-card-action" aria-hidden="true">Explore flavour <span>→</span></span></article>
<article class="flavour f-green"><div class="ingredient">🍃</div><h3>Miami Mint</h3><p>A clean mint profile with a cooling character.</p><span class="flavour-card-action" aria-hidden="true">Explore flavour <span>→</span></span></article>
<article class="flavour f-purple"><div class="ingredient">🫐 <span>🍓</span> <span>🧊</span></div><h3>Blue Razz Ice</h3><p>Blue raspberry-style berry notes with an icy finish.</p><span class="flavour-card-action" aria-hidden="true">Explore flavour <span>→</span></span></article>
<article class="flavour f-straw"><div class="ingredient">🍓 <span>🥝</span> <span>🧊</span></div><h3>Strawberry Kiwi Ice</h3><p>Strawberry and kiwi fruit notes paired with a cool finish.</p><span class="flavour-card-action" aria-hidden="true">Explore flavour <span>→</span></span></article>
<article class="flavour f-water"><div class="ingredient">🍉 <span>🧊</span></div><h3>Watermelon Ice</h3><p>Juicy watermelon character with a chilled finish.</p><span class="flavour-card-action" aria-hidden="true">Explore flavour <span>→</span></span></article>
</div>
<div class="true-life"><span>TRUE-TO-LIFE FLAVOURS</span><p>The BC10000 range is offered in a broad selection of fruit, mint and ice-inspired profiles. Exact flavour availability can vary by market and SKU.</p></div>
