<p>Your stock has been reserved and your Zoho Books invoice is ready. Complete payment through the secure PayPal-enabled payment page, then return here to verify your payment and confirm the order.</p>
<a class="btn btn-gold" href="#" id="paymentLink" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Pay securely</a>
<button class="btn btn-outline" id="verifyPayment" type="button">Verify payment &amp; confirm order</button>
</div>
<div class="payment-panel receipt-panel" hidden="" id="receiptPanel">
<h3>Payment confirmed</h3>
<p>Your order is confirmed. Your Zoho Books payment receipt is available below as proof of payment.</p>
<button class="btn btn-gold" id="downloadReceipt" type="button">Download payment receipt</button>
</div>
</form>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="faq" id="faq"><div class="container narrow"><div class="section-heading center"><p class="eyebrow gold-text">FAQ</p><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2></div><details><summary>What is the ELFBAR BC10000?</summary><p>The BC10000 is a rechargeable, pre-filled, non-refillable all-in-one vaping device in the ELFBAR range.</p></details><details><summary>How many puffs does the BC10000 provide?</summary><p>The stated capacity is up to 10,000 puffs. Actual usage varies according to individual puff duration and usage pattern.</p></details><details><summary>Is the BC10000 rechargeable?</summary><p>Yes. The supplied product profile specifies a 620 mAh rechargeable battery and USB-C charging.</p></details><details><summary>What nicotine strength is shown on this site?</summary><p>The Vestige product profile supplied for this range specifies 50 mg/ml. Always verify the exact product packaging and local requirements.</p></details></div></section>
<section class="information" id="information"><div class="container info-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow gold-text">VESTIGE VAPES</p><h2>Product information, clearly presented.</h2><p>Vestige Vapes is the vaping business of Vestige Ltd. The brand presentation uses the supplied Vestige Ltd identity while the website itself remains dedicated exclusively to the vape range.</p></div><div class="info-card"><h3>Connect with Vestige</h3><p>Instagram</p><a class="social" href="https://www.instagram.com/vestigeltdmp/" rel="noopener" target="_blank">@vestigeltdmp</a><a class="btn btn-gold" href="/contact">Contact Vestige</a></div></div></section>
